  "title": "MNDP: Strengthen heuristics",
  "description": "Miktrotik Neighbor Discovery Protocol is not IANA assigned to its\nport (5678), so strengthen the heuristics to avoid some observed\nfalse positives. Tested against the file available on the wiki\nSampleCaptures page, and some other known captures (and false\npositives.)\n\nAlso remove some commented out lines. The length field in this protocol,\nunlike some other similar protocols like CDP, does not include the\nlenght of the type and length fields itself.",
